# The report that the goat-processors runner reads: one JSON object whose
# keys are the shared-model keys themselves (goat-processors spec/correlate.md,
# Reports). Public, no external standard. `time_ms` is an integer, epoch ms.
format  goat-processors-report
version 0.2.0
distribution public
source  "USAREUR-AF/goat-processors spec/correlate.md, section Reports (Apache-2.0)"
uses    track
uses    radar
wire    json
field   track.source_id  track.source_id  string
field   uid       uid       string
field   time_ms   time_ms   int
field   lat       lat       float
field   lon       lon       float
field   hae       hae       float
field   ce        ce        float
field   course    course    float
field   speed_ms  speed_ms  float
field   type      type      string
field   stale_ms  stale_ms  int
field   callsign  callsign  string
field   time_error_ms  time_error_ms  float
field   time_state     time_state     string
field   radar.rcs_m2   radar.rcs_m2   float
